            0.883,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. According to the 2011 Census, the population of the town of Chintamani was about 75,000. How much less than one lakh is 75,000?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.291,
            0.541,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 75,000 is 25,000 less than 1 lakh."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.32,
            0.881,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. The estimated population of Chintamani in the year 2024 is 1,06,000. How much more than one lakh is 1,06,000?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.384,
            0.562,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 1,06,000 is 6,000 more than 1 lakh."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.414,
            0.881,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. By how much did the population of Chintamani increase from 2011 to 2024?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.457,
            0.719,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Increase in population from 2011 to 2024 is 31,000."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.486,
            0.883,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at the picture on the right. Somu is 1 metre tall. If each floor is about four times his height, what is the approximate height of the building? (Refer textbook for the picture)",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.56,
            0.282,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 40 m"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.589,
            0.881,
            0.63
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Which is taller — The Statue of Unity or this building? How much",
              "styles": [
